{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"没在想\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"text\": \"不再为想被珍惜自责后，他更清楚自己多想靠近，也盼对方同样珍惜自己，想看看两人能一起过怎样的日子。\",\n      \"key\": \"多想靠近\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他觉得自己有许多爱可以给，心里的这些感情也都值得珍惜，欢喜一涌上来，他连自己的得失都顾不上。\",\n      \"key\": \"许多爱可以给\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他仍盼对方也选择自己，可对方没给新保证，想要的回应还没有着落。\",\n      \"key\": \"回应还没有着落\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他只想让眼前的欢喜多留一会儿，暂时顾不上以后能不能如愿，等欢喜退下，想被珍惜的心还会回来。\",\n      \"key\": \"欢喜多留一会儿\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R51\", \"R52\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S12-1\", \"S12-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写并调整归属\",\n      \"why\": \"明确写出不再为渴望自责后，反而更清楚自己多想靠近；保留想被同样珍惜、想看看两人能共享怎样生活的愿望，把给予的丰盈感放到 S12-2，避免两条重复表达想给予。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R53\", \"R54\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S12-1\", \"S12-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留愿望仍在却暂时不再折磨他，以及他觉得有许多爱可给、心里的感情值得珍惜；用欢喜涌来时顾不上得失表现当下的饱满，不再写成仿佛真的再无所缺。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R55\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S12-1\", \"S12-2\", \"S12-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"拆分\",\n      \"why\": \"把想靠近和被珍惜的愿望、内在的饱满、对方没有新保证分别写清，避免把心愿得到抒发写成回应已经到手，也让未满足的期待继续牵动这一段。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R56\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S12-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留暂时顾不上未来、想让当下欢喜多留一会儿，以及欢喜退后期待会回来；不把此刻写成缺憾已经消失。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f6aa324d-2b7d-4309-afad-ae517d7e64d1", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T165101350172Z", "elapsed_seconds": 651.625, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T17:01:52.984221+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c1b66d07e24a18f501a60964c4c1ba4dc58b35f2dc0b34a5024f2b7965778e88", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T165101350172Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "5169b1c4e4c19e64e1ecb6811690ec7900fecf1dbc34f61f594496c30cb553bf"}}}
